                                "sense_id": "a8cb13d6-6d55-350c-b2e0-c074acc6289b",
                                "text": "The very rough leaves, uniformly chocolate-colored bark (when viewed crosssectionally), very mucilaginous, gluelike, and aromatic inner bark, wingless twigs, and eciliate fruits are distinctive."
                            },
